{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object. If visible, move towards it. If in reach, take object. Process object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
